  "jp": "龍樹の根本へと続くと思われた洞窟を{n}抜けると、そこは樹幹の内側に存在{n}していた巨大な空洞であった。{page}空洞はその天まで続くかに思われる{n}梢まで龍樹を縦に貫いており、遥か{n}上空から自然光が静かに降り注いで{n}いる。龍樹の直上に雨雲がかかって{n}いるのか、光はか細く、薄暗い。",
  "en": "Coming out of the cave they had taken{n}for the way to the Dragon Tree's roots,{n}they found themselves in a giant hollow{n}inside its trunk.{page}The hollow pierced the Dragon Tree{n}lengthwise up to its treetop, seeming to{n}reach the very sky, and natural light fell{n}quietly from far above. Perhaps rain{n}clouds hung directly over the Dragon{n}Tree, for the light was thin and dim."
 },
 {
  "id": "s0146_00920",
  "off": 2336,
  "term": "0C",
  "max": 148,
  "kind": "text",
  "refs": [
