  ],
  "jp": "その地は、巨木の内部に繁った森で{n}あった。龍樹の空洞はあまりに巨大で、{n}堆積した土にいつしか木々が芽吹き、{n}そのまま大きな森へと成長したので{n}あろう。",
  "en": "It was a forest grown lush inside a giant{n}tree. The Dragon Tree's hollow was so{n}vast that trees must have sprouted in{n}the piled earth, growing into a great{n}forest."
 },
 {
  "id": "s0146_009b4",
  "off": 2484,
  "term": "0C",
  "max": 208,
  "kind": "text",
  "refs": [
   7876
