  "ev": [
   "001"
  ],
  "fn": [
   560
  ],
  "speaker": [
   -1
  ],
  "who": [
   ""
  ],
  "jp": "そして――。{page}見上げた空に、巨大な影が覆い被さっ{n}ていた。風を孕み、天空を駆けるため{n}の雄々しき巨翼。尾は古代の鳥の祖の{n}ように鮮やかな羽根に包まれ、その{n}首は空を渡る風を読み取るが如くに{n}長く伸ばされている。",
  "en": "And then--.{page}A huge shadow loomed in the sky{n}overhead. Mighty giant wings, to take the{n}wind and race through the heavens. Its{n}tail was wrapped in vivid feathers, like the{n}ancestor of ancient birds, and its neck{n}stretched long, as if reading the winds{n}crossing the sky."
 },
 {
  "id": "s0146_00a84",
  "off": 2692,
