  "jp": "荒々しい胴間声が、巨大な空間に殷々{n}と響き渡った。と、蔦が絡んだ辺りの{n}樹壁に変化が顕れる。逞しい腕が生え、{n}次いで首、胴と、まるで木の中を同化{n}して泳いでいるかの如く、巨漢の妖魔{n}が樹壁を抜けて躍り出してくる。{page}それはＤ・Ｓたちの眼前に落下し、{n}凄まじい地響きを立てて着地した。",
  "en": "A rough, booming voice echoed around the{n}giant space. Then a change appeared in{n}the wall of the tree where the vines{n}were tangled. A brawny arm grew out,{n}then a neck and torso, and as if swimming{n}through the wood and merged with it, a{n}huge demon came dancing out through{n}the wall.{page}It dropped before the eyes of D.S. and his{n}party, landing with a terrific rumble."
 },
 {
